{{!
    @template local_coursegen/template_plan_activity

    One line under an activity's row saying what it is planned to cover.

    Only the line: the plan itself runs to dozens of entries, and it already has
    a home in the thread on the left, folded behind its own "Show more". Free
    mode's rows carry a one-line description for the same reason, which is the
    class this reuses.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * summary string - One sentence on what the activity will cover
    * hasparts bool - Whether the mould has anything to plan at all
    * emptylabel string - Shown when it does not

    Example context (json):
    {
        "summary": "Introducción a los componentes de un sistema informático.",
        "hasparts": true,
        "emptylabel": ""
    }
}}
<p class="cg-activity-desc cg-tpl-plan" data-region="template-plan">
  {{#hasparts}}{{summary}}{{/hasparts}}
  {{^hasparts}}{{emptylabel}}{{/hasparts}}
</p>
